---
import IzmirIcon from './IzmirIcon.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <div class="brand-row">
          <span class="brand-icon"><IzmirIcon name="saatkulesi" size={40} /></span>
          <div class="logo">
            İzmir<span class="logo-blue">Uzmanı</span><span class="logo-dot"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>İzmir’in gezilecek yerlerini, semtlerini, etkinliklerini ve şehir hayatını yerel gözüyle anlatan bağımsız şehir rehberi.</p>
        <a href="https://instagram.com/izmiruzmani" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="ig-btn">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
          @izmiruzmani
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <div>
          <p class="footer-label">Keşfet</p>
          <div class="footer-col">
            <a href="/rehberler">Rehberler</a>
            <a href="/etkinlikler">Etkinlikler</a>
            <a href="/etkinlikler/gecmis">Geçmiş Etkinlikler</a>
            <a href="/hakkinda">Hakkında</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="footer-label">Toplu Taşıma</p>
          <div class="footer-col">
            <a href="/toplu-tasima-saatleri">Tüm Saatler</a>
            <a href="/toplu-tasima-saatleri/metro">Metro</a>
            <a href="/toplu-tasima-saatleri/izban">İZBAN</a>
            <a href="/toplu-tasima-saatleri/vapur">Vapur</a>
            <a href="/toplu-tasima-saatleri/otobus">Otobüs</a>
            <a href="/toplu-tasima-saatleri/tramvay">Tramvay</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© {year} İzmir Uzmanı. Tüm hakları saklıdır. · <a href="/cerez-politikasi" class="legal-link">Çerez Politikası</a> · <a href="#" class="legal-link" data-cookie-prefs>Çerez Tercihleri</a></p>
      <p>İzmir’den sevgiyle</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer { background: #1b2340; color: #c9cfe0; padding: clamp(44px, 6vw, 72px) 20px 28px; }
  .footer-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .footer-top { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .footer-brand { max-width: 340px; }
  .brand-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .brand-icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff9f3; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .footer-brand p { font-size: 14px; color: #aab2c8; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .logo { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .logo-blue { color: #8fb0f5; }
  .logo-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #ff7c11; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ig-btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff;
    padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f58529 0%, #dd2a7b 50%, #8134af 100%);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .ig-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); color: #fff; }
  .footer-links { display: flex; gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px); flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .footer-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ffb26b; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .footer-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .footer-col a { font-size: 14px; color: #c9cfe0; transition: color 0.15s; }
  .footer-col a:hover { color: #fff; }
  .footer-bottom { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-top: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .footer-bottom p { font-size: 13px; color: #8890a8; }
  .legal-link { color: #aab2c8; }
  .legal-link:hover { color: #fff; }
</style>
